          {"type": "Label", "id": "splash-age-paragraph-1", "text": "1、本游戏是适用于年满8周岁及以上的用户，建议未成年人在家长监护下使用游戏产品。", "width": "100%", "whiteSpace": "normal", "fontFamily": "sans", "fontSize": 14, "lineHeight": 1.4, "fontColor": [91, 76, 47, 255], "flexShrink": 0, "marginBottom": 12, "children": []},
          {"type": "Label", "id": "splash-age-paragraph-2", "text": "2、本游戏中有用户实名认证系统，认证为未成年人的用户将接受以下管理：", "width": "100%", "whiteSpace": "normal", "fontFamily": "sans", "fontSize": 14, "lineHeight": 1.4, "fontColor": [91, 76, 47, 255], "flexShrink": 0, "marginBottom": 12, "children": []},
